  "title": "Bashkir — BGN/PCGN 2007",
  "language": "ba",
  "script": "Cyrl",
  "kind": "geographic",
  "status": "current",
  "year": 2007,
  "authority": "BGN/PCGN 2007 Agreement (table checked Aug 2019)",
  "description": "BGN/PCGN romanization of Bashkir Cyrillic: Ә→ə, Ғ→ğ, Ҙ→ź, Ҡ→q, Ң→ñ, Ҫ→ś, Һ→h, Х→x, Ж→j, Ч→ç, Ш→ş, Ё→ë, Ы→i; В→w and Е→ye word-initially and before a vowel; У/Ү→w after vowels; Ъ and Ь not romanized.",
  "sources": [
    "https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5d6f825aed915d08f9a72a4d/TABLE_OF_CORRESPONDENCES__FOR_BASHKIR.pdf"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Notes 1 and 2 are applied literally: В→w and Е→ye word-initially and before a vowel. 'Before a vowel' for Е may be a slip for 'after a vowel' (cf. other PCGN tables); Биишева therefore gives Biişewa, not Biişyeva.",
    "Note 3 (У/Ү→w between or after vowels) is applied after any vowel. Note 4 ('w is used after e, u, ö and ə') is not attached to any table row in the PDF and is not applied.",
    "Bashkir И has no İ in the PCGN inventory, so capital И is plain I."
  ],
  "alphabet": "абвгғдҙеёжзийкҡлмнңоөпрсҫтуүфхһцчшщъыьэәюя",
  "classes": {
    "V": "аәеёиоөуүыэюя"
  },
  "rules": [
    {"from": "в", "to": "w", "start": true, "note": "note 1"},
    {"from": "в", "to": "w", "before": "{V}", "note": "note 1"},
    {"from": "е", "to": "ye", "start": true, "note": "note 2"},
    {"from": "е", "to": "ye", "before": "{V}", "note": "note 2"},
    {"from": "у", "to": "w", "after": "{V}", "note": "note 3"},
    {"from": "ү", "to": "w", "after": "{V}", "note": "note 3"}
  ],
  "map": {
